      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456374::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "For the annealed AlCrTiZrMo film, reported tribocorrosion values include a friction coefficient of 0.04 and a wear rate of 1.34 × 10^-6 mm^3 N^-1 m^-1.",
